  1358: ["The opposition was firmly against the new proposal.", "Muhalefet yeni teklife sert şekilde karşı çıktı."],
  1359: ["Everyone aged eighteen and over has the right to vote.", "On sekiz yaş ve üstündeki herkesin oy hakkı var."],
